# knowledge-steward.lg — compiled from the governance block (SPEC §4). Generated; do not edit by hand.
human curator role curator
human data_protection_officer role data_protection_officer
human subject role subject
human workspace_owner role workspace_owner
actor knowledge_steward grade L2

gate ingest_dryrun risk low grant knowledge_steward
gate extract_concepts risk low grant knowledge_steward
gate propose_placement risk medium grant knowledge_steward
gate graph_write risk high grade L3 grant knowledge_steward
gate curate_canon risk high grade L3 grant knowledge_steward
gate graph_erase risk critical grade L4 grant knowledge_steward
gate release risk low

cord knowledge_steward -> ingest_dryrun
cord knowledge_steward -> extract_concepts
cord knowledge_steward -> propose_placement
cord knowledge_steward -> graph_write
cord knowledge_steward -> curate_canon
cord knowledge_steward -> graph_erase
cord ingest_dryrun -> release
cord extract_concepts -> release
cord propose_placement -> release
cord graph_write -> release
cord curate_canon -> release
cord graph_erase -> release
cord release -> master

prohibit direct_write_bypassing_path
prohibit binary_fetch_in_session
prohibit invent_node
prohibit unlogged_mutation
reserve graph_erase by data_protection_officer and workspace_owner
reserve curate_canon by curator
obligation single_write_path on release
obligation dry_run_then_confirm on release
obligation dedup_urn_sidecar on release
obligation legal_basis_recorded on release
obligation egress_checked on release
obligation erase_egress_limit_disclosed on release
redress graph_erase by subject within 30d
redress graph_write by workspace_owner overturn
